                                "example_id": "b77566c8-f8ce-4779-8884-354342fffe37",
                                "sense_id": "9cfacaa3-574b-3b80-9e6a-a32472be23b5",
                                "text": "A bishop of Bath […] was considered after due reflection to be an unsuitable man for the Archbishopric, because he had too many illegitimate children—not some, but too many."
